  "description": "Candidate serialized Resource only; not an Artifact or a runtime/database implementation. All ordinary references remain subject to per-consumer input_refs closure. prefix_rules.validate_prefix checks exact plan/action identities, owner/generation/book/scope, ordering, intent/permit lifecycle, interrupt monotonicity, subject non-attempt, complete chain and basis CAS. Hashing uses UTF-8 compact sort_keys=true ensure_ascii=false allow_nan=false JSON; event_hash omits only its own top-level member. PLAN_ACCEPTED actions bind the atomic permanent reservation; PLAN_ACTIONS_RESERVED is its index projection, not a later unlocked reservation window.",
